stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> EXECUTED
    EXECUTED --> OBSERVING: target applied
    EXECUTED --> BLOCKED_ROLLBACK: command incomplete
    OBSERVING --> BLOCKED_IDENTITY: identity drift
    OBSERVING --> BLOCKED_WINDOW: window or samples short
    OBSERVING --> BLOCKED_RECOVERY: metric/check failed
    OBSERVING --> BLOCKED_TRAFFIC: route not serving target
    OBSERVING --> BLOCKED_EVIDENCE: digest missing or changed
    OBSERVING --> RECOVERY_VERIFIED: all evidence pass
    RECOVERY_VERIFIED --> HUMAN_CLOSEOUT: owner reviews evidence
    HUMAN_CLOSEOUT --> [*]
